    <item>
      <title>Outlook Cache Mode for Shared Mailboxes</title>
      <link>https://diecknet.de/en/2021/11/19/Exchange-Online-Cache-Mode-Shared-Mailboxes/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 19 Nov 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>Andreas Dieckmann</author>
      <guid>https://diecknet.de/en/2021/11/19/Exchange-Online-Cache-Mode-Shared-Mailboxes/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;In newer Microsoft Outlook versions it is no longer possible to retrieve additional emails in cache mode for shared mailboxes. Instead, the following message appears at the end of the email list:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are more items in this folder on the server.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Connect to the server to view them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://diecknet.de/images/2021/2021-11-19-Es-sind-weitere-Elemente-in-diesem-Ordner-auf-dem-Server-vorhanden_Zoomed.png&#34; &gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://diecknet.de/images/2021/2021-11-19-Es-sind-weitere-Elemente-in-diesem-Ordner-auf-dem-Server-vorhanden_Zoomed.png&#34; alt=&#34;Outlook message: There are more items in this folder on the server. Connect to the server to view them.&#34;  title=&#34;Outlook message: There are more items in this folder on the server. Connect to the server to view them.&#34;  /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
